# GM-54 minimum app version RPC contract checks.
# Use 54361 for npm run qa:start (DEFAULT_QA_PORTS) or 54321 for npm run backend:start.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:54361
@publicKey = REPLACE_WITH_QA_PUBLIC_KEY

### 1. Read minimum Android app version policy anonymously (expected: HTTP 200 with minimumVersion '1.0.0')
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/get_app_version_policy
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"p_platform":"android"}

### 2. Unknown platform returns explicit null policy instead of server error (expected: HTTP 200, minimumVersion: null)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/get_app_version_policy
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"p_platform":"ios"}

### 3. Private schema table cannot be read directly via PostgREST (expected: HTTP 401/403/404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/app_release_config
apikey: {{publicKey}}
